Package: fio
Version: 3.24-1
Depends: libc, libssp, libaio, zlib
Source: package/utils/fio
License: GPL-2.0-or-later
LicenseFiles: COPYING
Section: utils
Architecture: ipq
Installed-Size: 326826
Description:  Fio is an I/O testing tool that will spawn a number of threads or
 processes doing a particular type of I/O action as specified by
 the user. Fio can be driven by a 'job file' describing the I/O
 load one wants to simulate.
